{"id":"rescate","lemma":"rescate","pos":"noun","rank":1743,"glosses":["rescue","ransom","bail-out, bail out"],"ipa":"/resˈkate/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"rescates"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-rescate.wav","examples":[{"text":"Fuimos a su rescate.","en":"We went to his rescue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734313","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Ellos vinieron de inmediato a nuestro rescate.","en":"They came to our rescue at once.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"immediately"]]},{"text":"Tom rehusó pagar el rescate.","en":"Tom refused to pay the ransom.","words":[null,{"g":"to refuse","l":"rehusar"},{"g":"to pay"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"El secuestrador pidió un rescate de dos millones de dólares.","en":"The hijacker demanded a ransom of two million dollars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522244","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"kidnapper"},{"g":"to ask for something","l":"pedir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"million","l":"millón"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"dollar","l":"dólar"}]},{"text":"Siguieron cantando hasta que llegó un equipo de rescate.","en":"They kept singing until a rescue team came.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692739","words":[{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"to sing","l":"cantar"},null,null,{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"team"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"until, till"]]}]}